  "title": "Champions Reel: How Iga Swiatek won Toronto 2026",
  "description": "No. 7 seed Iga Swiatek captured her 26th WTA Tour Driven by Mercedes-Benz title, 19th at WTA 1000 level or above, 15th on outdoor hard courts and first since Seoul 2025 at the 2026 National Bank Open. Swiatek defeated Elena Rybakina in the title match to notch her first Top 3 win since Roland Garros 2024 and improve to 26-5 overall in finals. Of the Grand Slams and WTA 1000 events on the current calendar, Swiatek's trophy cabinet is now only missing the Australian Open, Dubai and Wuhan.",
